is spike is not present after switching to single window mode.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6036b567-4da8-4e6d-9431-0ce75b1ba111)\nYou can see the renaming line edit took a while to show up\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f864c1f8-7fd8-457e-a542-e724ff86b9fc)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a empty project and a empty scene\n2. make sure single window mode is off\n3. right click or rename any node.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nA default project is created with 4.4\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19244940/test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"RawsharkTang","id":128461761,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6grwQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128461761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang","html_url":"https://github.com/RawsharkTang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RawsharkTang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104111/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}